  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASTRA: Doing Better Together</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASTRA&apos;s project &#x201c;Doing better together&#x201d; is the continuation of the project (Ref: SE-ON-802401-6134-WB-RS) under the 2024-2025 programme &#x201c;The Kvinna till Kvinna Regional Programme - Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents&#x201d; (Ref: SE-ON-802401-6134-WB).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the Kvinnna till Kvinna Foundation&#x2019;s regional programme &quot;Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents 2.0&quot; the partner organisation ASTRA is recieving core support. With the core funding ASTRA is aiming at contributing to the following project outcomes: - WROs, LGBT+ organisations and feminist movements have resources and capacity to deliver crucial core services, and support to empower and mobilize vulnerable women / LGBT+ persons. - WROs, LGBT+ organisations and feminist movements have resources to adapt to closing civic space and act to hold government / other stakeholders accountable on GBV and HR commitments. - WROs, LGBT+ organisations and feminist movements demonstrate increased resilience (through increased knowledge, integrated security measures, networks and resources) to counter the anti-democratic movements and GBV.</narrative>
  </description>
